      "title": "Choose a task you can check",
      "intro": "<p><strong>You will leave with:</strong> one small task, the information it uses, and a clear way to check the result. Allow about 8–12 minutes; this is an estimate, not a timer. No AI account is needed.</p>\n<p>Choose Everyday, Work or Technical examples below. You can change examples at any time. The skill is the same: give a tool a task whose result you can judge.</p>",
