                "feedback": "<p><strong>B is the best starting task.</strong> It uses the supplied limits and names what is missing. <strong>A</strong> assumes a library booking and budget that the source never gives. <strong>C</strong> checks tone, but a confident plan could still require twenty people. The two-hour total and twelve-person limit give you concrete checks.</p>"
