                "feedback": "<p><strong>C gives you a useful way forward.</strong> <strong>A</strong> expands internal reading access into a permission the case never grants. <strong>B</strong> treats one substitution as proof about the entire document. Use the invented process facts rather than carrying over the real complaint&#x27;s wording or identifying detail.</p>"
